personality_notes = "Rüfət, kan kardeşi — companion. Aras's blood brother, captain of the guard.
Grief stance: silent love — knows everything and lies to protect Aras from his own guilt;
promised 'Never tell me'. Carries Aras's letter to himself; carried him out of Közkale.
Joins in Act I ('You don't know me? ...Good.'). Downed, never killed in normal combat;
fate decided by the story [TBD]. Name memory: rufet_face. See STORY_BIBLE.md §7."
